<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-120.1-eec-program-strategy-designated-establishment-and-governance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3737" name="W3737. Energy Efficiency &amp; Conservation Program Strategy &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual planning (links to VS-33.1); RA 11285 obligation; program review
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise EEC program (~205 sites)
Owner: Energy Efficiency Officer (EEO) / Sustainability
Participants: EEO, Sustainability (links to VS-25), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Procurement (links to VS-34), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Renewable (links to VS-108), Cross-Entity (links to VS-72), Compliance (links to VS-22), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3737 — Energy Efficiency &amp; Conservation Program Strategy &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3737_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3737_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3737_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3737_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3737_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3737_Lane2" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3737_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3737_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3737_Start4" name="Annual planning (links to VS-33.1); RA 11285 obligation; program review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3737_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3737_Task5" name="EEO/Sustainability define the energy-efficiency &amp; conservation (EEC) program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Sustainability define the energy-efficiency &amp; conservation (EEC) program strategy and governance: scope (~205 sites — 200 stores, 4 DCs, HQ), the RA 11285 compliance map (designated-establishment status, energy audit, conservation plan, DOE reporting), the energy-management-system approach (ISO 50001 EnMS), the ECM investment strategy, and KPIs (energy intensity kWh/sqm, cost, audit compliance, ECM savings, GHG reduction)
Responsible (R): EEO / Sustainability
Accountable (A): COO / Sustainability
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3737_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3737_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3737_Task6" name="EEO establish the governance: EEO authority, the energy team (Facilities, Store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO establish the governance: EEO authority, the energy team (Facilities, Store Ops, Procurement, Finance, Sustainability), cross-functional responsibilities, and integration to facilities (VS-20.3), ESG (VS-25), renewable (VS-108), procurement (VS-34), and compliance (VS-22)
Responsible (R): EEO / Facilities / Sustainability
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3737_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3737_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3737_Task7" name="Executive committee ratify the EEC strategy, approve the program budget and ECM…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Executive committee ratify the EEC strategy, approve the program budget and ECM investment envelope (links to W3743), and report energy posture to the executive risk/sustainability committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-25.3) and board (links to VS-36); communicate the mandate
Responsible (R): COO / EEO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3737_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3737_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3737_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3737_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3737_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-138 (ensure RA 11285 energy compliance &amp; M&amp;V integrity.) | - operational: EEO authority; operational: compliance map (W3738)
Owner: Energy Efficiency Officer (EEO) / Sustainability</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3737_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3737_Annotation9" targetRef="W3737_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3737_Flow11" sourceRef="W3737_Start4" targetRef="W3737_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3737_Flow12" sourceRef="W3737_Task5" targetRef="W3737_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3737_Flow13" sourceRef="W3737_Task6" targetRef="W3737_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3737_Flow14" sourceRef="W3737_Task7" targetRef="W3737_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
