    <bpmn:process id="W_W3740" name="W3740. Energy Policy, Targets &amp; ISO 50001 Energy Management System" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W3737); certification cycle; target setting
Frequency: Annual + on cycle
Volume: Enterprise energy policy, targets, EnMS
Owner: EEO / Sustainability
Participants: EEO, Sustainability (links to VS-25), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Finance (links to VS-17.4), ESG (links to VS-25.3), Audit (links to VS-21), Renewable (links to VS-108)
Source: workflow W3740 — Energy Policy, Targets &amp; ISO 50001 Energy Management System</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3740_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3740_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3740_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3740_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3740_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3740_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3740_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3740_Start3" name="Strategy (W3737); certification cycle; target setting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3740_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3740_Task4" name="EEO/Sustainability maintain the energy policy and targets: the energy-intensity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Sustainability maintain the energy policy and targets: the energy-intensity reduction target (kWh/sqm), the renewable/clean-energy target (links to VS-108), the GHG-reduction contribution (links to VS-25/W192/W3466), and the ECM savings target; align to ESG/decarbonization strategy (links to VS-25.3)
Responsible (R): EEO / Sustainability / ESG
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
