        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO/Audit assure the EnMS through internal audit (links to VS-21) and management review, drive continual improvement (Plan-Do-Check-Act), and report EnMS performance and certification posture to governance (links to W3737/VS-25.3)
Responsible (R): EEO / Audit / Sustainability
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
