      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contract cycle; market change; site addition
Frequency: Per contract + ongoing
Volume: ~205+ utility accounts; retail-electricity supply
Owner: EEO / Procurement
Participants: EEO, Procurement (links to VS-34), Treasury (links to VS-18), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Renewable (links to VS-108), Retail Electricity Suppliers (RES)
Source: workflow W3742 — Energy Procurement, Retail Competition (RES) &amp; Contract Management</bpmn:documentation>
