      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3742_Task4" name="EEO/Procurement manage energy procurement and the retail-competition (RES)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Procurement manage energy procurement and the retail-competition (RES) strategy under the Philippine Retail Competition and Open Access (RCOA)/Energy Regulatory Commission framework for contestable accounts: source Retail Electricity Suppliers, negotiate contracts (price structure, term, indexation, green/renewable share), and optimize the ~205-account portfolio
Responsible (R): EEO / Procurement / Treasury
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Per contract + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3742_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3742_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3742_Task5" name="EEO/Procurement/Treasury manage the energy contract lifecycle and cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/Procurement/Treasury manage the energy contract lifecycle and cost: contract administration, price/volume reconciliation against consumption (links to W3741), market-tariff monitoring (WESM), and demand-response / peak-management where economic
Responsible (R): EEO / Procurement / Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3742_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3742_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3742_Task6" name="EEO/Finance publish energy-procurement cost analytics, drive sourcing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO/Finance publish energy-procurement cost analytics, drive sourcing optimization (supplier mix, green tariff, self-generation trade-off links to VS-108), and report energy cost to FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4) and program analytics (links to W3756)
Responsible (R): EEO / Finance / Procurement
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3742_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3742_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
