        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Finance develop the EEC program budget and ECM capex envelope: the operating budget (audit, monitoring, reporting) and the capital envelope for ECM projects (LED retrofit, HVAC upgrade, refrigeration optimization, BMS, renewable links to VS-108), aligned to annual capex planning (links to VS-33.1/VS-40)
