Responsible (R): EEO / Finance / PMO
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3743_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3743_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
