    <bpmn:process id="W_W3744" name="W3744. EEC Policy, Authority &amp; Records Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Policy cycle; audit; regulatory inspection
Frequency: Maintained + on event
Volume: EEC policy, authority, records
Owner: EEO / Compliance
Participants: EEO, Compliance (links to VS-22), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Records (links to VS-88), Audit (links to VS-21), Sustainability (links to VS-25), Finance (links to VS-17)
Source: workflow W3744 — EEC Policy, Authority &amp; Records Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3744_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3744_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3744_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3744_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3744_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3744_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3744_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3744_Start3" name="Policy cycle; audit; regulatory inspection">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3744_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3744_Task4" name="EEO/Compliance maintain the EEC policy and authority: the energy-management…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Compliance maintain the EEC policy and authority: the energy-management policy, the ECM investment authority (links to W3743), the energy-procurement authority (links to W3742), and the compliance obligations register (W3738)
Responsible (R): EEO / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3744_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3744_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3744_Task5" name="EEO/Records manage EEC documentation: DOE registration/designation (W3738)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/Records manage EEC documentation: DOE registration/designation (W3738), energy audits (W3745), conservation plans (W3748), ECM project records, M&amp;V reports (W3747), and DOE submissions (W3755); retention per VS-88 and RA 11285 IRR
Responsible (R): EEO / Records
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3744_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3744_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3744_Task6" name="EEO/Audit support DOE inspection/audit response (links to VS-22.2/W77), manage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO/Audit support DOE inspection/audit response (links to VS-22.2/W77), manage findings to closure, and report records/compliance posture to audit (links to VS-21) and governance (links to W3737)
Responsible (R): EEO / Audit / Compliance
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: On event + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3744_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3744_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3744_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3744_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
