        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-589 (ensure controlled execution — EEC Program Strategy, Designated-Establishment &amp; Governance (PA-120.1).) | - operational: documentation discipline; operational: authority matrix
Owner: EEO / Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
